NEXT STEPS FOR CLIENT
----------------------

Setup Instructions:

1. Create Vercel Project
   - Visit https://vercel.com
   - Import repository: kanaerulabs/jinit-labs-headache-awareness-trainer
   - Accept default Next.js settings

2. Link Local Project (optional, for getting IDs)
   ```bash
   npm i -g vercel
   cd <project-directory>
   vercel link
   cat .vercel/project.json
   ```

3. Create Vercel API Token
   - Visit https://vercel.com/account/tokens
   - Create new token: "GitHub Actions Deployment"
   - Save token securely

4. Add GitHub Secrets
   - Go to repository → Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions
   - Add three secrets:
     * VERCEL_TOKEN (from step 3)
     * VERCEL_ORG_ID (from .vercel/project.json)
     * VERCEL_PROJECT_ID (from .vercel/project.json)

5. Test Deployment
   - Create test PR to verify preview deployment
   - Merge PR to main to verify production deployment
   - Check GitHub Actions for workflow status

6. Verify PWA Features
   - Visit production URL on mobile device
   - Test "Add to Home Screen"
   - Enable airplane mode, verify offline functionality
   - Run Lighthouse audit (target: 90+ PWA score)

